    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "9 Old Bundoran Road presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom mid-terrace residence in this highly convenient location, situated directly opposite AbbVie and within easy walking distance of Sligo town centre.\r\nThe property is well positioned for access to a wide range of amenities and major employers, with Sligo University Hospital and Atlantic Technological University (ATU) Sligo both close by. Town centre is also within comfortable walking distance, making this an exceptionally convenient location for both owner-occupiers and tenants.\r\nThe house requires some modernisation and upgrading, offering purchasers an excellent opportunity to put their own stamp on the property to create a comfortable modern home. Subject to eligibility, the property may qualify for SEAI energy upgrade grants, potentially providing an opportunity to improve the energy efficiency.\r\nGiven its location, strong rental potential and scope for modernisation, this property represents a terrific opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a home within easy reach of Sligo town centre.\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\n4.1m x 1.8m\r\nLaminate wood flooring.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\n4.1m x 3.3m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fireplace with back boiler for solid fuel c/h.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room\r\n5.2m x 3.5m\r\nLaminate wood flooring in Dining area.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom No.1\r\n3.35m x 3.2m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fitted Wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom No.2\r\n3.6m x 2.8m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fitted Wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBedroom No.3\r\n2.3m x 2.3m\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fitted Wardrobe. \r\n\r\nBathroom\r\n1.9m x 1.7m\r\nTiled floor & shower surround. Electric Shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: D"
      }
    ],
